{"3214280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon Fete", "steam_appid": 3214280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/6850dbe64a719598c3a17a0f48a4e54f.avif?t=1784812543\" width=672 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Moon Fete Start from scratch and build your very own night market—every stall is your choice, free and bustling with life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/abc20680a9c70aaa2f61f5e50526529d.poster.avif?t=1784812543\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/abc20680a9c70aaa2f61f5e50526529d.webm?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/abc20680a9c70aaa2f61f5e50526529d.mp4?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/bf98bbe05ddd1462ab9620140e28c236.webp?t=1784812543\" width=1040 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/adb7229de6511cd6f673b0adea5aa165.avif?t=1784812543\" width=672 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heh~guess their top pick. Do they prefer a sweeter touch, or the rich taste of savory? Deduce the perfect answer and discover the secret seasoning that turns first-timers into loyal fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/ea7d4650d53b4664d49be8553c853b8f.poster.avif?t=1784812543\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/ea7d4650d53b4664d49be8553c853b8f.webm?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/ea7d4650d53b4664d49be8553c853b8f.mp4?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/bf98bbe05ddd1462ab9620140e28c236.webp?t=1784812543\" width=1040 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/ce8451ea43df5f681c3acdaa8b949c46.avif?t=1784812543\" width=672 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many stalls！collectors rejoice！ From local street snacks to exotic cuisines, each stall comes with its own little gnome helper! Dozens of themed stalls await your collection—every stall is the soul of the night market, and I want them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/026d03c8c2e3354a5f4e667d2bf1c48f.poster.avif?t=1784812543\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/026d03c8c2e3354a5f4e667d2bf1c48f.webm?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/026d03c8c2e3354a5f4e667d2bf1c48f.mp4?t=1784812543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/bf98bbe05ddd1462ab9620140e28c236.webp?t=1784812543\" width=1040 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/5d15aa80cb5da85f3d60f2cc1528fa60.avif?t=1784812543\" width=672 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special guests, secret tales Certain unique customers always seem to appear in the night market. Can you guess their tastes? And who are they really…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/19f6fd1034045baefd5053cac7a64cf3.avif?t=1784812543\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/bf98bbe05ddd1462ab9620140e28c236.webp?t=1784812543\" width=1040 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/6850dbe64a719598c3a17a0f48a4e54f.avif?t=1784812543\" width=672 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Moon Fete Start from scratch and build your very own night market—every stall is your choice, free and bustling with life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214280/extras/abc20680a9c70aaa2f61f5e50526529d.poster.avif?t=1784812543\" width=780 height=438 ><source src